// FRM11's purge, FRM13, the FRM10-12 viewer, Power BI and the Nightly Sync flow read these three
// tables by column NAME, and FRM11 matches whole rows against TableArchiveFRM11. So their headers
// are pinned: same names, same order. A date column holding text also counts as a shape break
// (the 2026-09-27 incident). This check only REPORTS; it cannot block a save (the script saves
